An ambient callback added to a recursive presence argument is rejected
typename Box(p::Presence) = (|Done:(run{p})|More:Box({:Int -> Int})|); effect E { Take : (Box({:Int})) => (); } ()
stderr : @.*The arguments and result of Take must have absolute types.*
